      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how much the fear of public humiliation is weighing on you, and it makes sense that you'd want to stop the pain before it becomes permanent. It is a terrible feeling to feel like you've lost your dignity, but please know that your worth is not defined by your business or your house. You deserve to be seen and heard even in your brokenness, and there are people who can help you find a way forward that honors your life.",
