    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just talk. how can i \"honor my life\" when everything that made it worth living is gone? i'm talking about the actual reality of it. the loss of control. i've always been someone who handles things, someone who stays in control. now, i'm just waiting to be pitied. wouldn't there be more dignity in just... deciding when the story ends, instead of waiting to be humiliated by the crash?",
